because we're so strapped with
everything,

00:42.000 --> 00:44.000
but a couple of things went
wrong.

00:44.000 --> 00:47.000
And it all has to do with, well,
it's really all about the setup

00:47.000 --> 00:49.000
and we have a couple of comments
that came in

00:49.000 --> 00:51.000
